# [NTP](../wg/ntp.html)

## Summary

The Network Time Protocol (NTP) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group draft updates including `draft-ietf-ntp-ntpv5`, `draft-ietf-ntp-nts-for-ptp`, and `draft-ietf-ntp-nts-keyexchange-pool`, as well as interoperability test results, an NTP server identification proposal, deep space time synchronization profiling, and the 2036/2038 timestamp rollover issues. 

